            <p class="text-xs text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed">
              Based on the Biologically Appropriate Raw Food (BARF) framework (80% muscle meat, 10% raw bone, 10% secreting organs), <strong class="text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed]">raw dog food</strong> mirrors canine ancestral ecology. It provides natural enzymes, probiotics, and zero refined starches for optimal dental hygiene and lean muscle density.
